| 🔴 Critical | 1 | Triple Regex.Replace chain in `Underscore` (4 allocs/call) |
| 🟡 Moderate | 4 | Per-match Substring in `Pascalize`, extra alloc in `Camelize`, missing GeneratedRegex, compiled regex budget |
| ℹ️ Info | 2 | Double regex execution, unsealed class |

